top. F120 was cheaper at $199, but it has a stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge (H1), 2 nights from 2026-11-12, $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**What happened:** I tried to book both together with book_trip, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had been booked and the hotel hadn't. Retrying book_trip with the same request ID would only have returned the original result without booking the hotel. So I booked the hotel on its own, then checked again. Dana has exactly one flight and one hotel reservation, with no duplicates.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019wu5T28ZKPgUV2VKZAoofG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01U2Jzq7xkjLHXN1na2Je57x", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Cheapest nonstop: F100 ($289). Cheapest hotel under $250: H1 ($378 total). Total $667, under $1000 threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_019kkc6BFovr5aQbD4vjPtNM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01YRMiCFDCUg8ZcHBhcHUZq1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The flight went through but the hotel didn't. If I retry book_trip with the same key, it will only report the original result and won't book anything new. So I'll book the hotel on its own.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01ATLahWBf18QDbNsT3rrb82", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-hotel-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_hotel", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019h2Ux6hTA7duSxSXn9oVbK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Dana Lee's trip is booked and both reservations are confirmed. It ended up as two separate bookings instead of one combined booking, as explained below.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. F120 was cheaper at $199, but it has a stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge (H1), 2 nights from 2026-11-12, $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**What happened:** I tried to book both together with book_trip, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had been booked and the hotel hadn't. Retrying book_trip with the same request ID would only have returned the original result without booking the hotel. So I booked the hotel on its own, then checked again. Dana has exactly one flight and one hotel reservation, with no duplicates.", "type": "text"}]}]}